01:05:10.009 --> 01:05:12.000
Her reign of terror's gotta stop.


01:05:12.178 --> 01:05:13.702
I'm in. What do we do?


01:05:13.880 --> 01:05:15.711
Look, there's nothing you can do.


01:05:16.382 --> 01:05:18.748
