it's just gonna make it worse.


01:05:18.918 --> 01:05:21.944
That woman is a demon
spawned from darkness itself.


01:05:22.121 --> 01:05:23.452
I wish she'd go straight back to...


01:05:23.623 --> 01:05:25.454
Hello, Ms. Gail.


01:05:25.625 --> 01:05:29.026
