to me.


01:05:53.753 --> 01:05:56.153
The only one who makes me
mac and cheese.


01:05:56.322 --> 01:05:58.517
You're annoying and ugly...


01:05:58.691 --> 01:06:00.090
...but I sort of love you.


01:06:02.528 --> 01:06:04.155
I sort of love you too.


01:06:04.764 --> 01:06:09.224
But just promise me
you're not gonna do anything, okay?


01:06:09.702 --> 01:06:11.294
- You too.
- Oh, come on.


01:06:11.470 --> 01:06:13.404
- Just... No... Ple...
- Just... No. Just...


01:06:13.572 --> 01:06:15.062
