- Just one...


01:06:15.975 --> 01:06:17.306
Okay.


01:06:17.576 --> 01:06:21.979
All right.
Well, now I get to go fold Bev's delicates.


01:06:37.496 --> 01:06:41.125
- Have you heard of knocking?
- Ever heard of I don't care?


01:06:41.400 --> 01:06:43.561
Where'd you put my blue blouse?


01:06:43.736 --> 01:06:45.829
Oh, okay.


01:06:46.005 --> 01:06:48.530
Okay, which one of these
do you like better?


01:06:49.442 --> 01:06:53.344
