and I can't talk to Luke about it.


01:07:19.538 --> 01:07:20.903
He'll say something like:


01:07:21.073 --> 01:07:24.008
"Oh, one minute
you're talented and we're connecting...


01:07:24.176 --> 01:07:27.407
