01:07:57.710 --> 01:07:59.439
Pretty doesn't last very long.


01:07:59.612 --> 01:08:01.546
Just look at Mom.


01:08:03.716 --> 01:08:04.842
You think I'm talented?


01:08:06.652 --> 01:08:08.745
