01:08:10.456 --> 01:08:11.980
Wear the blue blouse.


01:08:12.158 --> 01:08:14.126
It makes your eyes pop.


01:08:17.229 --> 01:08:18.457
This better work.


01:08:19.031 --> 01:08:21.261
Because if I go down,
you're go down with me.


01:08:34.246 --> 01:08:37.909
Yeah, yeah, yeah.
What's up, my party people?


01:08:38.084 --> 01:08:41.178
Yeah. All right, all right, all right.
Let's get this show started.


01:08:41.353 --> 01:08:45.346
