01:11:40.766 --> 01:11:41.790
Scratch that.


01:11:41.967 --> 01:11:44.902
Um, here are my boys, the Oral Majority.


01:11:53.612 --> 01:11:56.080
<i>I'm lost in a world that rattles my brain</i>


01:11:56.248 --> 01:12:00.150
<i>Cleaning up my life
From the mess you made, oh, oh</i>


01:12:02.955 --> 01:12:04.320
Move it. Guy.


01:12:04.490 --> 01:12:08.688
