01:12:14.800 --> 01:12:15.994
Well, it had better be.


01:12:16.168 --> 01:12:17.396
I have to pee.


01:12:17.569 --> 01:12:20.800
Oh, I will take you to the pee, Mr. Victor.


01:12:23.742 --> 01:12:25.573
Sorry.


01:12:26.011 --> 01:12:28.536
