01:12:36.722 --> 01:12:39.782
<i>No, not again</i>


01:12:39.958 --> 01:12:42.324
<i>Never again</i>


01:12:42.494 --> 01:12:45.827
<i>No, not again</i>


01:12:50.636 --> 01:12:51.967
My brothers, yeah!


01:12:52.137 --> 01:12:53.536
Okay.


