01:18:17.462 --> 01:18:20.659
<i>It's taught me to be
It's given to me</i>


01:18:20.832 --> 01:18:23.232
<i>And I'll survive</i>


01:18:23.402 --> 01:18:26.530
<i>'Cause I have blessed myself</i>


01:18:28.006 --> 01:18:34.878
<i>Do you ever wonder
How anything can make you cry?</i>


01:18:35.047 --> 01:18:38.710
<i>Have yourself discover</i>


01:18:38.884 --> 01:18:45.881
<i>That the pain you feel
Is the pain that you deny</i>


01:18:46.058 --> 01:18:49.323
<i>You can bless yourself</i>


01:18:49.494 --> 01:18:52.395
<i>There's no need for someone else</i>


01:18:52.564 --> 01:18:59.993
<i>There's no one to blame
There's no one to save you but yourself</i>


01:19:00.172 --> 01:19:03.369
<i>I can justify</i>


01:19:03.542 --> 01:19:06.511
<i>All the mistakes in my life</i>


01:19:06.678 --> 01:19:09.772
<i>It's taught me to be
It's given to me</i>


01:19:09.948 --> 01:19:12.439
<i>And I'll survive</i>


01:19:12.617 --> 01:19:15.347
<i>'Cause I have blessed myself</i>


01:19:32.871 --> 01:19:34.532
