Guy!


01:21:21.079 --> 01:21:24.742
I will have my nirvana moment.


01:21:24.983 --> 01:21:28.749
<i>I'll make you believe in me</i>


01:21:30.222 --> 01:21:33.282
<i>I can be what you want me to be</i>


01:21:33.458 --> 01:21:36.052
Oh, come on. Look alive, people.
I'm a star.


01:21:36.228 --> 01:21:37.786
Let's try this again.


01:21:37.996 --> 01:21:39.861
<i>I'll make you believe...</i>


01:21:41.433 --> 01:21:44.163
Oh, no. You want a piece of me?


01:22:09.828 --> 01:22:12.058
Hey. Clear.


01:22:27.746 --> 01:22:29.907
<i>Run this town tonight</i>


01:22:30.081 --> 01:22:32.447
Where's breakfast...? Sorry.


01:23:14.326 --> 01:23:16.920
<i>I'm lost in a world
That rattles my brain</i>


01:23:17.095 --> 01:23:19.962
<i>I'm cleaning up my life
From the mess you made, oh, oh</i>


01:23:24.936 --> 01:23:28.463
- Katie, are you wearing a doormat?
- Welcome.


01:23:34.913 --> 01:23:36.972
Thanks. Now the pants.


01:23:42.153 --> 01:23:46.453
And then it would just take you somewhere
that you never expected you would go.


01:23:50.895 --> 01:23:53.887
<i>You wanna hear
the monologue from My Fair Lady?</i>


01:23:54.065 --> 01:23:56.192
Oy, mate, oy.


01:24:15.687 --> 01:24:17.552
I love my life.


01:24:17.722 --> 01:24:19.917
<i>Call me.
- Hello?</i>


01:24:42.380 --> 01:24:45.577
<i>Yeah. You like it? You like it? Yeah.</i>

